  "title": "Backend Audit",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Backend Audit"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is a bit much so I apologize in advance but I would love for you to have a look at the backend overall. It's a hot mess right now and I've been meaning to refactor it for months."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Right now I'm using PocketBase and Express. Most of the data is coming in from external APIs like cablecast so I'm using JSON fields within the organization entity to store that stuff so I don't have to do a individual thousand round trips to import/export/fetch data. Probably a terrible idea in hindsight but it works well... I wonder how you would approach it. I'm thinking maybe some kind of graphDB would've been a better choice but I'm not sure. I'm not as fluent in backend as frontend and still learning as I go."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Can you provide a comprehensive breakdown of how the architecture can be improved? A mermaid diagram illustrating the optimial architecture for the backend would be helpful as well. I'll share the rest of the files here:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "// @ts-check"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import express from 'express'"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import bodyParser from 'body-parser'"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import path from 'node:path'"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "import cors from 'cors'"
        }
