    {
      "id": "b-140",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "* This endpoint handles the retrieval of timeslots for the organization. It first checks the last sync time stored in the app's local variables. If more than an hour has passed since the last sync, it triggers a sync with PocketBase to fetch the latest timeslots and updates the last sync time. If less than an hour has passed, it fetches the timeslots from the local cache. The resolved data is then sent as a JSON response."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-141",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "* @param {Object} req - The request object."
        }
